WEBVTT

00:49:27.329 --> 00:49:30.871
Yes. And I also thought it was
interesting that, well,

00:49:30.871 --> 00:49:32.163
you were writing Dear Sugar,

00:49:32.163 --> 00:49:37.204
you were giving people advice
and in wild you weren't.

00:49:37.913 --> 00:49:39.996
But people have read it that way.

00:49:40.329 --> 00:49:43.413
And I'm wondering how you feel about that,

00:49:43.413 --> 00:49:45.246
that whole sort of notion
of advice giving.

00:49:45.246 --> 00:49:53.871
I know you've referred to self-help work
as intellectually mushy and and I think

00:49:53.871 --> 00:49:57.454
I think that, too. But I do
think that people look

00:49:57.454 --> 00:50:01.954
for that in work even when it's
not there for their own needs.